    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d302-a2">

                <pb facs="1078" n="928" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg928"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Declaration.</hi></head>
                <p>The undersigned, duly authorized by their respective Governments, declare that in
                    consequence of the dissolution of the union between Norway and Sweden, the
                    treaty concluded by Norway and Sweden with France and Great Britain concerning
                    the integrity of the United Kingdoms of Norway and Sweden, and signed at
                    Stockholm on November 21, 1855, has ceased to be in operation as far as concerns
                    the three Governments since the date of the above-mentioned dissolution.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Done in triplicate at
                            <placeName>Christiania</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-11-02">the 2d day of November, 1907</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. Lövland</hi></signed>. [<hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">l. s.</hi>]<lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Delavaud.</hi></signed>. [<hi rendition="#small-caps">l.
                            s.</hi>]<lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. G. Max
                        Müller</hi></signed>. [<hi rendition="#small-caps">l. s.</hi>]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
